    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0089" n="15" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg15"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 16, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge with thanks
                    the receipt of your note of the 12th instant, transmitting a copy of a note from
                    his excellency the governor <pb facs="0090" n="16" xml:id="pg16"/> general of
                    Canada relative to the alleged existence of a military organization in Canada of
                    fugitives from the United States, which formed the subject of my communication
                    of the 29th ultimo to Lord Lyons.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
